 excels at housework, studies and sports, and on to top it off, she's cute. She's like an idol at the school Haruomi attends. For some reason, she really wants to take care of Haruomi, which brings out her jealous side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c9762"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“織節家”の次女で、春臣と同い年の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事、勉強、運動ともにそつなつこなす、しっかり者の優等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛い容姿と相まって、学園ではアイドル的な存在になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"春臣の世話を何かと焼きたがり、ちょっぴりヤキモチ焼きな一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ドンマイドンマイだよ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15752","sourceWorkId":"10713","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"三姉妹の次女、主人公と同い年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しっかり者で家事も勉強も運動もできる優等生で、おまけにかわいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が通う学園のアイドル的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何かと主人公の世話を焼きたがり、ちょっと焼きもちやきな一面も。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15752","sourceWorkId":"12049","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"メインヒロインの1人。織節三姉妹の次女で巨乳。しっかりかつヤキモチ焼きな性格。春臣とは同い年かつ幼馴染で級友。自宅でも学園でもソツの無い、才色兼備の元気な美少女として人気者である。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"28361"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15752","sourceWorkId":"10713","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15752","sourceWorkId":"10713","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15752","sourceWorkId":"10713","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"53 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15752","sourceWorkId":"10713","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"42 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15752","sourceWorkId":"10713","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":