ne, often using strange methods. Even more strange is the fact that the results are quite accurate. She speaks gently and politely."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c9763"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“織節家”の長女で、目を見張らんばかりの巨乳の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりほんわかした優しい女性で、ですます調で話す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"占いが大好きで、常にあらゆる占いをチェックしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弱点はお酒。匂いだけで酔ってしまい、酔うと酒乱になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私…いやらしいんでしょうか…？　春ちゃん……」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15753","sourceWorkId":"10713","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"三姉妹の長女。年齢は20代前半、巨乳美女。おっとりとした優しい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お酒がまったく飲めず（匂いだけで酔ってしまう）、飲むと酒乱になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"占いが大好きで、常にあらゆる占いをチェックしている。ですます調でしゃべる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15753","sourceWorkId":"12049","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"長女。巨乳美女。おっとりとした優しい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お酒がまったく飲めず（匂いだけで酔ってしまう）、飲むと酒乱になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"占いが大好きで、常にあらゆる占いをチェックしている。ですます調でしゃべる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私…いやらしいんでしょうか…？　春ちゃん…」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47632"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"107 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15753","sourceWorkId":"10713","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"165 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15753","sourceWorkId":"10713","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15753","sourceWorkId":"10713","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15753","sourceWorkId":"10713","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"48 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15753","sourceWorkId":"10713","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},